{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16936","headline":"宜阳所居白蜀葵荅咏柬诸公 · 武元衡","name":"宜阳所居白蜀葵荅咏柬诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冉冉衆芳歇，亭亭虚室前。\n敷荣时已背，幽赏地宜偏。\n红艳世方重，素华徒可怜。\n何当君子愿，知不竞喧妍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16936.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16936","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}